From b89ee4e5ead3d510b9bbe46c05fd4773e30a15f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saironcb <saironbusatto@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:53:14 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 33/44] feat: arena ML policy v2 (DeepSets, any arena size) and
 logged action probability

ArenaMlNet.h evaluates the arena-policy v2 weights written by ml/policy/train_v2.py with the standard
library only (checked against torch by train_v2.py --selftest). The multiplier now uses the v2
observation and any arena team slot (2v2 or 3v3) listed in Playerbots.ArenaMlTeams. Each logged arena
action carries the probability the policy gave it (1 when only the rules decide). The unused v1
observation and 48-input network are removed.
